<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7182" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναπηδ-άω</span></b> , poet. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμπ-,</span>
		fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Asin.</u>
					53
				</span></i>
			:—<i>leap up, start up,</i> esp. in haste or fear, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ λόχου ἀμπήδησε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.379
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τοῦ θρόνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.155
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναπηδῶσιν πάντες ἐπ᾽ ἔργον</span>
			<i>jump up</i> from bed, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				490
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.4.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πρὸς τὸν πάππον</span>
			<i>jump up on</i> his <i>knees,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.3.9
			</span></i>; <i>start up</i> to speak, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐν δήμῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					356
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				428
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὸ βῆμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.173
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.71
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of water,
				<i>spring,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				596b18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Medic.,
				<i>swell up,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Gland.</u>
				2
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
